@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
title UC01 — Alternatif 2: Email Sudah Terdaftar
actor "Calon Pengguna" as User
boundary ":HalamanOtentikasi" as UIo
control ":AkunController" as AC
entity ":Akun" as Akun
User -> UIo: kirimFormulirPendaftaran(nama, nim, email, kataSandi, setujuKebijakan)
UIo -> AC: daftarAkun(nama, nim, email, kataSandi, setujuKebijakan)
AC -> AC: validasiKelengkapanFormulir(nama, nim, email, kataSandi, setujuKebijakan)
AC -> AC: validasiDomainEmail(email)
AC -> AC: cekKeunikanEmail(email)
AC -> Akun: cariByEmail(email)
Akun --> AC: akun (surel sudah terdaftar)
note right of AC: Pendaftaran dibatalkan (KF05)
AC --> UIo: false (surel sudah terdaftar)
UIo -> UIo: tampilkanPesanGalat("Email sudah terdaftar. Gunakan email lain atau masuk.")
@enduml
